itle":"题陈肤仲真希元诗卷赠萧道士萧善为诗亦解鼓琴 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"手撇飞鸢上五溪，两牛腰大送行诗。\n犹嫌言语无多子，古锦奚囊长自随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31943,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈肤仲真希元诗卷赠萧道士萧善为诗亦解鼓琴 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"吾庐几研半生尘，朋友相邀问保邻。\n旅进群咻浑易事，邻家老子是何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31944,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题陈肤仲真希元诗卷赠萧道士萧善为诗亦解鼓琴 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"是间正位至虚灵，都把精神逐外明。\n劝子抱琴归旧隐，乱云深处认真情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31945,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵丁制置远迎三绝 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"溪瘴蛮烟隔市朝，十年山径长蒿茅。\n好风吹送知时雨，生意洋洋大国郊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31946,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵丁制置远迎三绝 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"乔松挺挺百年期，霜雪无端顿系之。\n一点阳和消不断，春风又长岁寒枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31947,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵丁制置远迎三绝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"锦里论交三十年，浮筠大玉透中边。\n投荒已作无期别，梦觉依然堕我前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31948,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王茶马海棠四绝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"一春风雨乱书堆，挂口林閒未放开。\n浩荡和风褰客袂，来看大树簇池台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31949,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王茶马海棠四绝 其三 王氏花屋海棠","author":"魏了翁","text":"宅在道傍如宝坊，一奁明玉飏新妆。\n当年共赏人何在，万里相思梦寐香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31950,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王茶马海棠四绝 其二 清淑堂海棠","author":"魏了翁","text":"善识花人尽倚阑，不将荣悴等閒看。\n繁华夺目春如醉，独肯怀人问考槃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31951,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王茶马海棠四绝 其四 燕王宫","author":"魏了翁","text":"二十四番花信风，川原无处著繁红。\n逢人谩说燕宫旧，废址荒营暝霭空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31952,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵史少庄竹醉日移竹 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"平生自许岁寒操，醉日移来三十丁。\n底事此君亦移转，连明风雨唤教醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31953,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵史少庄竹醉日移竹 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"清如杜叟日卓午，直似姜公诗作丁。\n冰雪容颜俨相值，霸陵醉尉也须醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31954,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵史少庄竹醉日移竹 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"猩屐常为醉魂役，骊珠适与睡时丁。\n外物移人每如此，人心可使不长醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31955,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵外舅杨崇庆以诗相招 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"去年湖上看花时，拍槛呼鱼酌酒卮。\n鱼计主人已非昔，犹惊故处上钩迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31956,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张太博见贻 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"门前车马尘滔滔，试问有谁閒似我。\n夜灯照出千古心，晓窗掣破重玄锁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31957,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵张太博见贻 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"别后几如隔世人，閒中认得当年我。\n清风应傍笑谭来，明月不随门户锁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31958,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政龙鹤山庐 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"世事从头数，时机触眼奇。\n山灵莫留客，大厦要人枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31959,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政龙鹤山庐 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"天公富万有，秋事不曾贫。\n静阅岁时信，动观天地仁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31960,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政龙鹤山庐 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"山色醉痕边，溪声客枕前。\n山溪元自旧，人已别经年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31961,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政和薛秘书诗见寄 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"行有尚时观习坎，不终止处认兼山。\n止中自有流行好，不在从违用舍间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31962,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政和薛秘书诗见寄 其五","author":"魏了翁","text":"书来寄我薛公诗，磊落襟期尉我思。\n所谓伊人在空谷，公侯逸豫镇无期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31963,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政和薛秘书诗见寄 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"寒城眺晚牛羊下，翠荡涵秋鹳鹤飞。\n风雨灯前话畴昔，应怀坡颍不成归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31964,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政和薛秘书诗见寄 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"扶木之阴三万丈，晓光绝出众山尖。\n分明大路平如掌，朝发昆崙夕至崦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31965,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政和薛秘书诗见寄 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"将相时来应不免，人生难得自由身。\n及今且续宋一艺，莫逐虫鱼注李巡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31966,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"稚金老火战重围，京洛缁尘点客衣。\n输却东园南阁老，水花阑槛夕阳稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31967,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其五","author":"魏了翁","text":"月华如水恰中庭，乌鹊枝头栖复惊。\n晚暑三亭随雨过，秋声一半在虫鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31968,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"怒涛撞击吼笼铜，惊倒江边百岁翁。\n西望阴霾犹未定，火云偏在五云东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31969,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"坱圠群灵付大钧，人生于世本何营。\n浩然中夜存存气，不藉西风梦亦清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31970,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其六","author":"魏了翁","text":"怒雷噀雨吹尘沙，樛枝草树纷笼加。\n可怜荷屋风不定，但有白红三数花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31971,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政秋怀十绝 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"书棚尚有送春诗，又见秋风满范围。\n夜雨床头多酿酒，天边一舸有人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31972,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政赋蟆颐新堰 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"八表云昏气候偏，秋霖成泽市乘船。\n平舟老子閒无事，看尽熙丰祐圣年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31973,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政赋蟆颐新堰 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"夏秋雨集浍沟盈，雨过江空洲渚生。\n事到无根元易涸，要将心地作池城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31974,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李参政赋蟆颐新堰 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"蟆颐江上静无涛，永逸功夫在一劳。\n昨晚秋风原上看，长腰粳米荐琴高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31975,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李彭州乞鹤于虞万州 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"宾朋满座酒如江，雪月风花应接忙。\n揽尽山林閒富贵，沧江公子太彊梁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31976,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李彭州乞鹤于虞万州 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"江头夜钓雨连明，可是渔翁太不情。\n白鹤纵违华表约，黄鸡应念越人盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31977,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李彭州乞鹤于虞万州 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"沧江羽客亦悠哉，水畔梅边雪斗皑。\n白鹤山头曾有约，至今华表望归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31978,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李彭州访山居三绝 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"不须更草北山文，归去开关扫白云。\n兴未尽时仍重访，我非辟世可同群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31979,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李彭州访山居三绝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"只嫌湫隘近城居，无着名山万卷书。\n不道八荒皆我宇，独于此处认吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31980,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨尚书立春 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"帽屋钗梁剪綵新，谁知井底及池濒。\n只从阳月方中日，已作明年第一春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31981,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨尚书立春 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"行玉盘中惊杜老，扣窗声里唤祈宾。\n扶持大道须公等，正恐乡车未可巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31982,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"为怜一片晓云红，未放千丝暮雨浓。\n调燮阴阳贤岳牧，满川花意得舂容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31983,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其六","author":"魏了翁","text":"指麾红紫思无滨，抵当丹青笔有神。\n百树花閒一编易，主人意韵镇长新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31984,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"惯踏郊原浩荡春，重来春与物俱新。\n渠虽自有生生意，把握天机是主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31985,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其五","author":"魏了翁","text":"帝恐嘉花不易成，好风迟日故来承。\n繁红错眩渔人眼，不识沧江有武陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31986,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"沙暖花香弄午晴，苦撩诗思浩难禁。\n偷閒不办追年少，只有春风会此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31987,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎沧江海棠六绝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"妙处东皇可得知，溶溶生意不停机。\n雨寒日暴浑无赖，凭仗阳和为解围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31988,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎海棠花下怯黄昏七绝 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"唐人春深题，用韵工车斜。\n逐逐语言去，谁欤真识花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31989,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎海棠花下怯黄昏七绝 其四","author":"魏了翁","text":"临川数落花，康节爱花谢。\n若作荣悴观，此特花之下。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31990,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵黄侍郎海棠花下怯黄昏七绝 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"曾访郊原春，静观烟雨妆。\n因物得良晤，谅非昔如棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31991,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞永康十月海棠 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"冷淡庭梅俨玉颜，孤高翠竹耸脩鬟。\n如何富贵天然质，犹欲寻盟二友间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31992,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞永康十月海棠 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"春意何曾间四时，芸芸静处锦成帷。\n非关造化呈新巧，钧播无心自不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31993,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞退夫除夕七绝句 其六","author":"魏了翁","text":"人道渠阳尔崄艰，崄艰在彼我何关。\n却从楚泽宽平后，彫尽从前镜里颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31994,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞退夫除夕七绝句 其五","author":"魏了翁","text":"长叹熙丰祐圣年，偏轻偏重几番船。\n谁能装载亭匀了，多著男儿尽力牵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31995,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞退夫除夕七绝句 其七","author":"魏了翁","text":"虞倩思亲感岁年，归心巫峡暮云前。\n乖逢逝止那能料，静倚閒云看大川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31996,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵虞退夫除夕七绝句 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"蜀人谁不望西还，何事天公独我悭。\n两度来逢单阏岁，腥风血雨满人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31